Third-party material
--------------------

Parts of this repository are adapted from the Qiskit Textbook
(https://github.com/Qiskit/textbook), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
The adapted parts have been modified.

- shors-algorithm/: the phase-estimation layout and the continued-fraction
  post-processing follow the textbook's "Shor's Algorithm" chapter. Versions
  of src/shors.py and notebooks/01_Shor_Walkthrough.ipynb before the MIT
  license was added also contained a modified copy of the textbook's
  c_amod15 and qpe_amod15 functions.
- quantum-teleportation/: the circuit layout and the split into z and x
  classical registers follow the textbook's "Quantum Teleportation" chapter.
- grover-search/: the diffuser construction follows the textbook's
  "Grover's Algorithm" chapter.
- qkd-bb84/ and quantum-secure-storage/: versions before the MIT license
  was added built one single-qubit circuit per bit and measured each with
  shots=1 and memory=True, as in the textbook's "Quantum Key Distribution"
  chapter. The current versions batch the qubits differently.
